 was Tadini in Brivio's Alfa Romeo, leaving a trail of oil all around the circuit.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":17},{"lap":1,"text":"Caracciola exits the tunnel first with Nuvolari right behind; Tadini's Alfa stops at the pits and retires.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":1,"text":"A broken oil line on the Alfa Romeo of Mario Tadini on the opening lap led to multiple incidents in the chicane after the tunnel; the Mercedes-Benzes of Chiron, Luigi Fagioli, and Manfred von Brauchitsch, as well as Giuseppe Farina's Alfa Romeo and Bernd Rosemeyer's Typ C of newcomer Auto Union, were all eliminated there.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":17},{"lap":2,"text":"When Chiron arrived, he hit the slippery oil before the chicane and slid straight through the barrier into the sandbags with very minor damage to the front of his car.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":16},{"lap":2,"text":"Farina crashes head-on into the barrier, Brivio hits it too but continues, and Brauchitsch runs into the tail of Farina's Alfa.","q":false,"c":15},{"lap":2,"text":"Trossi stops in the broken barrier and loses time; Siena stops at the chicane and retires. Nobody is hurt.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":2,"text":"When Chiron arrived, he hit the slippery oil before the chicane and slid straight through the barrier into the sandbags with very minor damage to the front of his car.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":16},{"lap":2,"text":"Farina crashes head-on into the barrier, Brivio hits it too but continues, and Brauchitsch runs into the tail of Farina's Alfa.","q":false,"c":15},{"lap":2,"text":"Trossi stops in the broken barrier and loses time; Siena stops at the chicane and retires. Nobody is hurt.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":3,"text":"Rosemeyer spins exiting the chicane but hits nothing.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":3,"text":"Rosemeyer spins exiting the chicane but hits nothing.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":6,"text":"Rosemeyer stops 40 seconds for a carburetor adjustment; Varzi up to third, ahead of Stuck.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":6,"text":"Rosemeyer stops 40 seconds for a carburetor adjustment; Varzi up to third, ahead of Stuck.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":9,"text":"A course worker throws sand in Fagioli's face; he spins into the wall at the chicane exit and stalls.","q":false,"c":12},{"lap":9,"text":"A course worker throws sand in Fagioli's face; he spins into the wall at the chicane exit and stalls.","q":false,"c":12},{"lap":10,"text":"Nuvolari passes Caracciola for the lead.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":10,"text":"Nuvolari passes Caracciola for the lead.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":12,"text":"Brivio hands car 28 to Farina.","q":false,"c":4},{"lap":12,"text":"Brivio hands car 28 to Farina.","q":false,"c":4},{"lap":13,"text":"Rosemeyer slides backwards into the stone balustrade at Massenet and is out, unhurt.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":13,"text":"Rosemeyer slides backwards into the stone balustrade at Massenet and is out, unhurt.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":14,"text":"The order on lap 14 was: Nuvolari, Caracciola, Varzi, Stuck and Wimille followed by the already lapped cars of Trossi, Farina/Brivio, Sommer, Etancelin and the others.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":14,"text":"The order on lap 14 was: Nuvolari, Caracciola, Varzi, Stuck and Wimille followed by the already lapped cars of Trossi, Farina/Brivio, Sommer, Etancelin and the others.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":18,"text":"Nuvolari leads Caracciola by a few seconds; Varzi is over a minute behind in third, Stuck close behind him.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":18,"text":"Nuvolari leads Caracciola by a few seconds; Varzi is over a minute behind in third, Stuck close behind him.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":25,"text":"After 20 laps Nuvolari's lead to Caracciola shrunk to just three seconds on lap 25.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":25,"text":"After 20 laps Nuvolari's lead to Caracciola shrunk to just three seconds on lap 25.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":27,"text":"The rain becomes a downpour; Caracciola passes Nuvolari at the Gasometer hairpin.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":27,"text":"The rain becomes a downpour; Caracciola passes Nuvolari at the Gasometer hairpin.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":29,"text":"Trossi retires with a broken distributor drive.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":29,"text":"Trossi retires with a broken distributor drive.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":37,"text":"Etancelin hits a curb, bends a wheel and splits his fuel tank; he retires at the pits.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":37,"text":"Etancelin hits a curb, bends a wheel and splits his fuel tank; he retires at the pits.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":50,"text":"He was over half a lap ahead of Nuvolari by 1m21.5s, Stuck by 2m01.8s, followed by Varzi and the rest","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":50,"text":"He was over half a lap ahead of Nuvolari by 1m21.5s, Stuck by 2m01.8s, followed by Varzi and the rest","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":57,"text":"Stuck catches Nuvolari on lap 56 and passes him on the next lap.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":57,"text":"Stuck catches Nuvolari on lap 56 and passes him on the next lap.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":58,"text":"Nuvolari stops 15 seconds to refuel; Varzi takes third and Nuvolari is lapped.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":58,"text":"Nuvolari stops 15 seconds to refuel; Varzi takes third and Nuvolari is lapped.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":76,"text":"Varzi laps in 2m10s, gaining about two seconds a lap as Stuck eases off.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":76,"text":"Varzi laps in 2m10s, gaining about two seconds a lap as Stuck eases off.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":83,"text":"Varzi passes Stuck; Stuck stops 18 seconds for fuel and is lapped by Caracciola.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":83,"text":"Varzi passes Stuck; Stuck stops 18 seconds for fuel and is lapped by Caracciola.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":98,"text":"Stuck, chasing Varzi, laps in 2m07.4s.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":98,"text":"Stuck, chasing Varzi, laps in 2m07.4s.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":100,"text":"Caracciola wins without a stop, 1m49.1s ahead of Varzi; Stuck third, a lap down.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":100,"text":"Tazio Nuvolari in the Alfa Romeo 8C benefitted from the chaos, only to suffer brake fade, and Rudolf Caracciola, proving the truth of his nickname, Regenmeister (Rainmaster), went on to win for Mercedes.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":0},{"lap":100,"text":"Caracciola wins without a stop, 1m49.1s ahead of Varzi; Stuck third, a lap down.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":100,"text":"Tazio Nuvolari in the Alfa Romeo 8C benefitted from the chaos, only to suffer brake fade, and Rudolf Caracciola, proving the truth of his nickname, Regenmeister (Rainmaster), went on to win for Mercedes.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":0}]}